e team's gender makeup, it might be more useful to look at what made those specific past teams dysfunctional—was there a strong manager? Clear roles? Reasonable workload? If you can identify the actual mechanism, you can build safeguards into your new team regardless of its composition, and you'll have a much stronger basis for predicting how it'll go than gender alone gives you.
